Elytra Fluid Flight - changelog
===============================

Versions are listed newest first. Each entry has an English section followed by a
Simplified Chinese section.


1.0.2+mc26.2 - 2026-09-30
-------------------------

Added
  * Optional lava swimming, controlled by two new config options:
    `lavaSwimmingWithFireResistance` and `lavaSwimmingWithoutFireResistance`. Both are off
    by default, because vanilla never enters the swimming state outside of water.
  * With the option matching the player's situation enabled, holding sprint with your eyes
    in lava enters the same swimming state as water: liquid movement takes over and jump
    means "swim up" instead of opening the elytra. Lava gliding is unchanged while both
    options stay off.
  * Five integration checks cover the defaults, both Fire Resistance cases, and that lava
    swimming blocks the glide launch (57 checks in total).
  * Settings screen for Mod Menu (client side), so every option can be changed in game. Mod
    Menu stays optional: it is only a compile-time dependency, and the entrypoint is loaded
    only when Mod Menu is actually installed. The screen edits the same config file and writes
    it when it is closed.

Changed
  * Version bumped to 1.0.2+mc26.2.


1.0.1+mc26.2 - 2026-09-28
-------------------------

Fixed
  * Liquid drag no longer compounds. The configured value used to multiply the whole
    elytra velocity every tick, so 0.6 left only 0.6^10 = 0.6% of the speed after half
    a second and gliding in water or lava stalled almost immediately. Only a tenth of
    the configured value is now applied as damping per tick: 0.6 keeps roughly 96% of
    the speed per tick and 0.35 roughly 93.5%. Liquids still feel thicker than air,
    but the player keeps their momentum.
  * Swimming and gliding are now separate states. While the vanilla swimming state is
    active (sprinting with your eyes under water) water movement takes over, and jump
    means "swim up" instead of opening the elytra. Stop sprinting and the glide
    resumes. Before this change the liquid glide blocked swimming entirely for as long
    as an elytra was worn.
  * README.md and README.zh-CN.md now describe the real drag behaviour and the new
    swimming rule; the old text advertised behaviour the code did not have.

Changed
  * Version bumped to 1.0.1+mc26.2.
  * Integration suite extended from 47 to 52 checks: per-tick retention values, a
    regression check that liquid drag cannot compound into a stop, and checks that
    swimming blocks the glide launch but non-swimming players can still launch.
  * License changed to a dual license: the mod is now offered under the Unlicense
    or, alternatively, under the MIT license. Both texts ship with the project
    (LICENSE and LICENSE-MIT).


1.0.0+mc26.2 - 2026-09-28
-------------------------

Added
  * First public release, built for Minecraft Java 26.2, Fabric Loader 0.19.5 and
    Java 25.
  * Elytra gliding continues in water and in lava instead of ending on contact.
  * Launching the elytra while submerged: float clear of the bottom, then press jump.
  * Firework boosts work in liquids, with vanilla consumption and boost duration.
  * Configurable water and lava drag, plus an optional Fire Resistance requirement
    for lava gliding.
  * Vanilla behaviour kept: elytra durability, landing, levitation and ladder
    restrictions, drowning, lava burn and explosion damage.
  * A mod icon taken from an in-game underwater glide, shown in Mod Menu and Fabric
    mod lists.

License
  * Released into the public domain under the Unlicense.


1.0.2+mc26.2 - 2026-09-30（简体中文）
------------------------------------

新增
  * 可选的岩浆游泳，由两个新配置项控制：`lavaSwimmingWithFireResistance` 与
    `lavaSwimmingWithoutFireResistance`，默认都是关闭——原版在非水液体里不会进入游泳
    状态，所以在启用对应选项之前，岩浆依旧不能游泳。
  * 开启与自身情况相符的那一项后，在岩浆中按住冲刺、眼睛浸在岩浆里，就会像在水里一样
    进入游泳状态：移动交回液体物理，跳跃只作上浮、不再展开鞘翅。两项都关闭时，岩浆滑翔
    照旧，行为与 1.0.1 一致。
  * 新增 5 项集成检查，覆盖默认值、两种耐火情况，以及「岩浆游泳阻止起飞」（合计 57 项）。
  * 新增 Mod Menu 游戏内设置界面（客户端），所有选项都能在游戏里改。Mod Menu 仍是可选项：只在
    编译期依赖，入口只有在确实安装了 Mod Menu 时才会加载。界面编辑的是同一份配置文件，关闭时
    写回。

变更
  * 版本号升到 1.0.2+mc26.2。


1.0.1+mc26.2 - 2026-09-28（简体中文）
------------------------------------

修复
  * 液体阻力不再复利。旧实现每个游戏刻都把整个鞘翅速度乘以配置值，0.6 在半秒后
    只剩 0.6^10 = 0.6%，水里和岩浆里的滑翔几乎立刻停住。现在每刻只按配置值的一成
    施加阻尼：0.6 相当于每刻保留约 96% 速度，0.35 约 93.5%。液体依然比空气更
    「厚」，但玩家的惯性得以保留。
  * 游泳与滑翔现在是两个互相隔离的状态。只要进入原版游泳状态（在水下按住冲刺），
    移动就交回水的物理，跳跃只做上浮、不再展开鞘翅；松开冲刺后继续滑翔。改动之前，
    只要穿着鞘翅，液体滑翔就会完全挡住游泳。
  * README.md 与 README.zh-CN.md 改为描述真实的阻力行为与新的游泳规则，旧文案宣传的
    是与代码不符的行为。

变更
  * 版本号升到 1.0.1+mc26.2。
  * 集成测试从 47 项扩展到 52 项：加入每刻保留比例、液体阻力不可复利归零的回归检查，
    以及「游泳阻止起飞、未游泳可正常起飞」的检查。
  * 许可证改为双许可：本模组现在以 Unlicense 或 MIT 授权释出，二选一。两份正文都随
    专案提供（LICENSE 与 LICENSE-MIT）。


1.0.0+mc26.2 - 2026-09-28（简体中文）
------------------------------------

新增
  * 首个公开版本，面向 Minecraft Java 26.2、Fabric Loader 0.19.5、Java 25。
  * 在水和岩浆中继续用鞘翅滑翔，而不是一接触就收翼。
  * 液体中也能起飞：先浮离底部方块，再按跳跃键。
  * 烟花推进在液体中同样有效，保留原版的消耗与飞行时间。
  * 水中与岩浆中的阻力可配置，并可要求岩浆滑翔必须具备耐火效果。
  * 保留原版行为：鞘翅耐久、落地收翼、漂浮与梯子限制、溺水、岩浆灼伤与爆炸伤害。
  * 模组图标取自游戏内水下滑翔的截图，会显示在 Mod Menu 与 Fabric 模组列表里。

许可
  * 以 Unlicense 释出，进入公有领域。
